  "notes": [
    "This is an explicitly new composition made from original native rail and post pixels; it is not a claimed native extracted 16-mask family.",
    "Native vertical rail was shifted from x2..5 to x6..9 and one original native post shifted to centre x8. Horizontal rail sampled only from the clear two-pixel space between native posts, then repeated.",
    "No source colors, anti-aliasing, rotation, smoothing or invented post/rail pixels are used. Components are copied at native scale.",
    "All four directions, all outer turns, endpoint masks, T junctions, crosses and isolated cap are defined. Each connected boundary passed full four-pixel alpha continuity checks."
  ]
